    "Authorization, upload without autoprint, files/download/metadata/history remain available while detached; print returns 503 and no false ready notification is sent. Restoring original CRC configuration recovers explicitly without reset; latched shutdown remains failed. Acquired devices all release and process dependencies close once.",
